{"name":"Tera Chad / God tiers","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":28,"casual":{"lead":["Tera Chad and 'God tier' are informal labels for looks said to sit above Giga Chad on the community's rating scale. Members use them for the most striking men and women, such as in threads like 'Tera Chad vs Tera Stacy', and for the end point of a looksmaxxing journey.","The tiers are not measured or standardised. Members also attach 'god tier' to individual features, such as skin, masseters or hair, so the term works as both a rating rung and a general superlative."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["The terms are used when comparing photos, nominating examples and discussing what a feature or physique would need to reach the top. They sit in the PSL-style vocabulary of tiers, with Tera as a step beyond Giga."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["The tiers are subjective and comparison-driven. The community discusses them as rankings, and nothing about them is medical or standardised."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"God tier skin after stop Tretinoin","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/god-tier-skin-after-stop-tretinoin.943904/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240316234520/https://looksmax.org/threads/god-tier-skin-after-stop-tretinoin.943904/"},{"title":"Guide GOD TIER MEMORY STACK [STUDYCELS, IQCELS, GTFIH!!]","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/god-tier-memory-stack-studycels-iqcels-gtfih.682270/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230501012642/https://looksmax.org/threads/god-tier-memory-stack-studycels-iqcels-gtfih.682270/"},{"title":"Mog Battle Tera Chad vs Tera Stacy","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/tera-chad-vs-tera-stacy.604427/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221116023227/https://looksmax.org/threads/tera-chad-vs-tera-stacy.604427/"},{"title":"god tier masseters chewmaxx